       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COVERAGESTATES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 UNIQUE-ITEM PIC X.
       01 GROUP-A.
          05 DUPLICATE-ITEM PIC X.
       01 GROUP-B.
          05 DUPLICATE-ITEM PIC X.
       01 SORT-RECORD PIC X.
       01 SINK-ITEM PIC X.
       01 OUTER-GROUP.
          05 MIDDLE-GROUP.
             10 LEAF-ITEM PIC X.
          05 OTHER-GROUP.
             10 MIDDLE-GROUP.
                15 LEAF-ITEM PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE UNIQUE-ITEM TO SINK-ITEM.
           MOVE DUPLICATE-ITEM TO SINK-ITEM.
           MOVE MISSING-ITEM TO SINK-ITEM.
           RELEASE SORT-RECORD.
           MOVE LEAF-ITEM OF MIDDLE-GROUP OF OUTER-GROUP
             TO SINK-ITEM.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM COVERAGESTATES.
